show-pdf-tags v1.7

The XML output from show-pdf-tags has been extended to show the
PDF version as <PDF version="2.0">

The Schema have been updated to optionally allow this attribute
and if present enforce that it has value 2.0 for the PDF/UA-2 schema
or 1.4, .. 1.7 or 2.0 for the UA-1 schema.

In addition several new structure elements that are introduced in the
current latex-dev release are now supported by the schema.


